WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:04.471
(crowd chatters)

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:07.743
(slow inspirational music)

00:00:07.743 --> 00:00:09.413
- [Narrator] These women
are some of the most

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:12.163
badass athletes you've ever seen.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:14.786
My name's Kelly Cantwell.

00:00:14.786 --> 00:00:17.185
I'm also known as Momster Mash.

00:00:17.185 --> 00:00:19.906
In my previous life, I
was an HR professional

00:00:19.906 --> 00:00:22.947
and now I'm a roller skating instructor

00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:25.019
for the Kansas City Roller Warriors

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:28.186
and an aspiring Roller Derby Girl.

00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:33.152
(calm music)

00:00:34.214 --> 00:00:35.824
- [woman] Alright, guys, come and eat.

00:00:35.824 --> 00:00:39.157
- Being a mom is a very interesting job.

00:00:41.381 --> 00:00:44.857
My husband is Chris,
then we have two boys,

00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:46.524
Emerson and Elliott.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:49.198
That's the four of us.

00:00:49.198 --> 00:00:50.615
We are very busy.

00:00:53.212 --> 00:00:56.020
I had this super stressful, crazy

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.571
hectic more than full-time job working

00:00:58.571 --> 00:01:01.504
as a Director of HR for a nonprofit.

00:01:01.504 --> 00:01:03.776
I always thought that
roller derby would be

00:01:03.776 --> 00:01:06.504
an awesome way to like
let out some aggression.

00:01:06.504 --> 00:01:09.254
(crowd chatters)

00:01:10.259 --> 00:01:12.509
But we started having kids.

00:01:13.555 --> 00:01:15.946
Then I heard about this
program that was like

00:01:15.946 --> 00:01:16.980
fitness skating.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.952
It was drills and skills
based on roller derby,

00:01:19.952 --> 00:01:22.138
but no impact with other skaters

00:01:22.138 --> 00:01:23.746
so there's no risk of injury,

00:01:23.746 --> 00:01:26.913
and I absolutely fell in love with it.

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:32.084
Then Chris accepted the job to teach here

00:01:32.084 --> 00:01:34.684
and I started up the
local Kansas City branch

00:01:34.684 --> 00:01:36.127
of that group.

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:39.225
I still remember when we bought a Subaru.

00:01:39.225 --> 00:01:41.704
We were expecting
Emerson, we wanted to get

00:01:41.704 --> 00:01:45.204
something a little bigger
that felt a little safer.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:48.425
When I think of Subaru, I do
think of an active lifestyle.

00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:51.186
People are using their
Subarus to go skiing

00:01:51.186 --> 00:01:54.885
or go hiking or go play
ice hockey or roller derby.

00:01:54.885 --> 00:01:57.073
We've always got bags of gear in the back.

00:01:57.073 --> 00:01:59.219
We got ice hockey gear for Emerson,

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:01.696
my roller derby bag.

00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:04.134
That's just how we roll.

00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:07.634
(calm instrumental music)

00:02:09.918 --> 00:02:12.105
When I brought Derby Lite here with me,

00:02:12.105 --> 00:02:13.472
I knew no one.

00:02:13.472 --> 00:02:15.165
I had to reach out to rinks.

00:02:15.165 --> 00:02:17.771
I had to find people who
would want to do this

00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:20.633
like new skating program.

00:02:20.633 --> 00:02:22.986
When I was in HR, it was something

00:02:22.986 --> 00:02:25.747
that I definitely took
home with me at night.

00:02:25.747 --> 00:02:27.646
It was really hard on my family.

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:30.040
Now, I get to do something
I absolutely love,

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.023
like I'm passionate about
it and I'm hanging out

00:02:32.023 --> 00:02:33.640
with friends.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.644
(team cheers)

00:02:35.644 --> 00:02:38.531
When skaters have completed
their Learn to Skate classes,

00:02:38.531 --> 00:02:41.173
they can go to their
Warriors in Training program,

00:02:41.173 --> 00:02:42.492
which is then how they get drafted

00:02:42.492 --> 00:02:44.755
to be on a competitive league team.

00:02:44.755 --> 00:02:46.409
- [Announcer] Ladies and
gentlemen, let's take...

00:02:46.409 --> 00:02:48.556
- I'm actually signed up to start

00:02:48.556 --> 00:02:51.242
the Warriors in Training
program next month

00:02:51.242 --> 00:02:52.558
so hopefully in a couple of months

00:02:52.558 --> 00:02:54.841
you'll be able to see Momster Mash as part

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:56.958
of one of the local home teams.

00:02:56.958 --> 00:02:58.652
That just made it really
official saying that to you

00:02:58.652 --> 00:03:01.295
right now with all these cameras.

00:03:01.295 --> 00:03:04.128
(classical music)

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:11.366
The challenge is just
staying more connected

00:03:11.366 --> 00:03:14.220
when things feel super busy.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.580
Even with things that we
love, I want to make sure

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.100
that we are still moving
forward with all of us

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.117
with our goals.

00:03:21.117 --> 00:03:22.980
We'll just keep going after what we love

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.661
and make sure that we're
cheering each other on.

00:03:25.661 --> 00:03:27.443
- Go Emerson.

00:03:27.443 --> 00:03:30.526
- [Kelly] Yeah, the sky's the limit.

